  questId: bacon
  recipe: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 877b90c2d8e059e46bca9a3753599d0d, type: 2}
  prerequisites: []
  lockedText: ...
  offerText: I haven't eaten in so long... If it's not too much trouble, could you
    whip something up for me? I've got a bit of bacon left.
  reminderText: "Crispy or burnt, it doesn't really matter\u2014and don't forget
    to bring \"a plate\" so I can share some with you."
  exactText: "You did great. It might not be anything fancy, but thank you for making
    the effort\u2014I'm definitely going to enjoy this."
  extraText: I think I'll be full for a long time now, so thank you so much, truly.
